    "Time words like 어제 (yesterday) and 내일 (tomorrow) must match the verb's tense." : {
      "comment" : "Note for the MistakeType.tense case.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zeitwörter wie 어제 (gestern) und 내일 (morgen) müssen zur Zeitform des Verbs passen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les mots de temps comme 어제 (hier) et 내일 (demain) doivent correspondre au temps du verbe."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kata waktu seperti 어제 (kemarin) dan 내일 (besok) harus sesuai dengan kala kata kerjanya."
